Jungle mein ek sher rehta tha, jo apni taqat par bahut ghamand karta tha।
Ek din usne dekha ki ek chhoti si cheenti bina dare apna bojh utha rahi hai।
Sher hans pada, lekin cheenti boli,
“Taakat sirf sharir mein nahi, hausle mein hoti hai।”
Ye sunkar sher samajh gaya ki asli shakti ghamand nahi, samajh aur mehnat hai।
